#ASSERT `Art 86(2) my immediate lower instance is an upper court, or another federal statute provides for appeal from another judicial authority` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- S54b seat Art 86(2) another federal statute provides for appeal
#ASSERT `Art 86(3) my canton may have set up an authority other than a court as immediate lower instance` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- S55a seat Art 86(3) predominantly political
#ASSERT `Art 86(3) my canton may have set up an authority other than a court as immediate lower instance` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- S55b seat Art 86(3) not predominantly political: limit of a grant, P2/P3
#ASSERT `Art 87(1) the appeal lies directly against the cantonal enactment I challenge` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- S56a seat Art 87(1) no cantonal remedy
#ASSERT `Art 87(2) Art 86 applies to my appeal against the cantonal enactment` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- S56b seat Art 87(2) the canton gives a remedy
-- Voting-rights matters: the act is an act of the last cantonal instance / of the Federal Chancellery / of a cantonal government.
